chapter AFP

session MFODL_Monitor_Exec = MFODL_Monitor_Devel +
  description
    "The verified executable monitor: the evaluator emstep/eeval, which refines the kernel's
     evaluation function over short tuples with executable window structures, its compiler from
     the kernel's state, and the formula rewrites it runs with.  Log_Monitor composes it with the
     verified log parser of session Log_Parser, from the bytes of the log to the verdicts, and
     Log_Monitor_Online states its correctness for the online interface; Monitor_Code holds the
     code-generator setup that VeriMon's code export (session VeriMon_CLI) relies on."
  sessions
    Log_Parser
  theories
    Tuple_Fields
    Frame
    Frame_Aux
    Until_Gen
    Window
    Agg_Gen
    Since_Agg
    Until_Agg
    Agg_Cache
    Window_Dispatch
    Trigger_Window
    Release_Window
    Swag
    Trigger_Swag
    Match_Window
    Kernel_Call
    Eval
    Correct
    Compile
    Idx_Code
    Frz_Rewrite
    Share_Rewrite
    Push_Rewrite
    Prepare
    Tuple_Code
    Mono_Sweep
    Agg_Code
    Map_Upd_Code
    RBT_Code
